From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:33:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 038/111] Fold chevrons in the gutter, and edits and column
 blocks unfold folds

Chevrons right of the line numbers: a folded header always shows one
pointing right, a foldable one shows one pointing down on hover over the
gutter or on the cursor line. A click toggles that block only, without
moving the cursor or starting a selection.

After every key in the text box and every app edit (paste, cut, undo,
redo, replace via TabChanged) folding::reconcile unfolds the fold holding
the cursor and every fold that no longer is exactly its header's block,
so edited text never stays hidden. A column block unfolds the lines it
covers; fold commands leave column mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

